---
description: Repository rules for self-documenting code and completed work
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the repository-wide rules at the start of `AGENTS.md`. They apply to
Cursor and all plugins and skills, including the completion discipline, running
only tests related to your changes (never unfiltered full-repo test sweeps unless
explicitly requested with `HOBO_ALLOW_BROAD_TESTS=1`), using `@effect/tsgo`
(`pnpm run typecheck:effect`) for Effect code, fetching `https://alchemy.run/llms.txt`
before guessing Alchemy URLs (`llms-full.txt` only for specific per-resource API
references), using `@alchemy.run/domain/Story` BDD stories for domain models,
and the prohibition on explanatory comments, deferred-work markers, and planning
or design documents.
